  "action_permissions": "Movement rejects walls, bounds and old occupied cells. Entering an active gate is free for the owner pair; rivals need one charge, transferred to the owner. The unowned gate rejects new entry. Bypass entry requires two charge. Bid requires at most one-cell distance, inactive rights and sufficient old liquid charge. Sharing requires adjacent fixed partner; relay requires standing on a beacon, both rights held by the own pair, one charge and an old-empty destination. Delivered actors may still help; only deliver is disabled. Joint terminal permits only wait; all invalid actions become wait.",
